### FitTrack API tests
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (click "Send Request" above each block).
### Log in first; REST Client keeps the auth cookie for the following requests.

@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### Register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@1234",
  "age": 22,
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "heightCm": 162,
  "weightKg": 60,
  "activityLevel": "LIGHT",
  "fitnessGoal": "GAIN_MUSCLE"
}

### Login (demo account from the seed script)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@fittrack.app", "password": "Demo@1234" }

### Current user
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/dashboard

### List workouts
GET {{base}}/workouts

### Create workout with exercises
POST {{base}}/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Upper body",
  "type": "STRENGTH",
  "durationMin": 45,
  "date": "2026-09-29",
  "caloriesBurned": 280,
  "notes": "Created from api-tests.http",
  "exercises": [
    { "name": "Push-up", "muscleGroup": "CHEST", "sets": 3, "reps": 15 },
    { "name": "Pull-up", "muscleGroup": "BACK", "sets": 3, "reps": 8 }
  ]
}

### Mark a workout complete (replace the id)
PATCH {{base}}/workouts/REPLACE_WITH_WORKOUT_ID/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{ "completed": true }

### Meals for a day + daily summary
GET {{base}}/meals?date=2026-09-29

###
GET {{base}}/meals/summary?date=2026-09-29

### Add meal
POST {{base}}/meals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mealType": "SNACK", "foodName": "Banana", "calories": 105, "protein": 1.3, "carbs": 27, "fats": 0.4, "date": "2026-09-29" }

### Progress
GET {{base}}/progress

###
POST {{base}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-09-29", "weight": 78.1, "waist": 87.5, "bodyFat": 21.2 }

### Goals
GET {{base}}/goals

###
POST {{base}}/goals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "goalType": "LOSE_WEIGHT", "title": "Reach 76 kg", "targetWeight": 76, "targetDate": "2026-12-31" }

### Exercise library (external API through the backend)
GET {{base}}/exercises?muscle=CHEST&equipment=Dumbbell

### Recommendations and achievements
GET {{base}}/recommendations

###
GET {{base}}/achievements

### Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
